{"body": "The Product Analyst II position aligns with my experience in processing complex datasets, constructing analytical dashboards, and using quantitative methods to generate actionable business insights. My background in data modeling and automated analysis directly supports the analytical tasks required for this role.

In my project work, I analyzed over Rs. 15 lakh crore in RBI UPI transaction datasets using SQL, DAX, Power Query, and Power BI to evaluate payment trends and deliver KPI-driven insights. I also developed a tax fraud detection system that evaluated over 500,000 GST transaction records using Python, SQL, and PostgreSQL to identify shell entities and circular trading patterns. Additionally, during my web development and AI integration role at Unirols Airtex, I structured product data to improve navigation and integrated an AI chatbot to automate product inquiries.

I look forward to discussing how my technical skills and data analysis background can support your team.", "cite": ["f2274908-d3d0-4ded-9070-19438afca006", "5d0738ce-8574-45fb-94ff-c18c64ef2d63", "075f61c4-0efe-4a84-8684-39b9696660a9"], "confident": true}
